# What `vercel deploy` must never upload.
#
# The CLI uploads the working directory, so without this the local .env — with
# the Supabase service-role key, the Apify token and the OpenAI key — would be
# sent to the build. Real values belong in the project's Environment Variables,
# set once and encrypted at rest, not shipped with every deploy.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build output and caches: Vercel builds from source.
.output
.vercel
.wrangler
.tanstack
node_modules
dist

# Local-only tooling and notes.
.claude
.lovable
*.docx
